    Returns:
        创建的游戏数据

    Raises:
        ValueError: 当gid已存在时

    Example:
        >>> service = GameService()
        >>> game = service.create_game(GameCreate(gid="1001", name="Test"))
        >>> print(game['name'])
        Test
    """
    pass
```

